        <StateMachine name="Pip" id="0:7">
            <!-- Body: the modes Pip holds, and the Reactions Pip plays once from the
                 Any state, each returning to the current mode at its end. The
                 runtime never moves a layer into the state it is already in, so
                 each Reaction has a second, identical state ("again"): the Any
                 state lists the first, then the second, and the same Reaction
                 fired while it plays starts over in whichever is not playing.
                 No Reaction state resets the pose on entry: a Reaction, new or
                 the same again, starts its timeline from the beginning and
                 blends in over 160 ms from wherever Pip is, never from rest. -->
